    "content": "<img class=\"userimg img-a-r\" src=\"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/s/common/uploaded_files/1711247040-f0e4443ae58814bfb46845fe448c5850.png\">The <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/anime/31240/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><i>Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu</i></a> (<i>Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-</i>) special stage at AnimeJapan 2024 revealed new staff, additional cast, and the first promo for the <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/anime/54857/\" rel=\"nofollow\">third anime season</a> on Sunday. The television anime is scheduled to premiere in October 2024.<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/50037/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aya Yamane</a> (<i>Himesama \"Goumon\" no Jikan desu</i>) is joining the cast as Liliana Masquerade.<br>\n<br>\nStaff<br>\nDirector: <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/38963/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Masahiro Shinohara</a> (<i>Gochuumon wa Usagi desu ka? Bloom</i> assistant director)<br>\nCharacter Design, Chief Animation Director: <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/45251/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Haruka Sagawa</a> (<i>Yofukashi no Uta</i>)<br>\nMonster Design: Keitarou Chiba (<i>Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu</i> sub-character design)<br>\nArt Director: <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/32087/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ryouka Kinoshita</a> (Bihou) (<i>Honzuki no Gekokujou</i>)<br>\nDirector of Photography: <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/73026/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Miori Miyagi</a> (T2studio)<br>\n3D Director: Kazuhei Tanaka (Felix Film) (<i>Initial D</i> 3DCG)<br>\nAnimation Producer: <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/73027/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shinichiro Katou</a> (<i>Sengoku Youko</i>)<br>\nStudio: <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/314/\" rel=\"nofollow\">White Fox</a><br>\n<br>\nReturning staff include series composer <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/19175/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Masahiro Yokotani</a> (<i>Seishun Buta Yarou wa Bunny Girl Senpai no Yume wo Minai</i>) and music composer <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/39642/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kenichiro Suehiro</a> (<i>Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute!</i>).<br>\n<br>\nThe anime adapts <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/32649/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tappei Nagatsuki</a>'s <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/manga/74697/\" rel=\"nofollow\">fantasy drama light novel</a>, which he <a href=\"http://ncode.syosetu.com/n2267be/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">originally began</a> the series on the Shousetsuka ni Narou website in April 2012. Kadokawa began releasing the series featuring illustrations by <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/people/32651/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shinichirou Ootsuka</a> through its MF Bunko J imprint in January 2014 and shipped the 36nd volume on December 25 last year. The 37th volume is scheduled to go on sale on March 25.<br>\n<br>\nWhite Fox produced the first anime season in Spring 2016. The <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/anime/39587/\" rel=\"nofollow\">second season</a> aired in split cours, with the first cour airing in 13 episodes in Summer 2020 and the 12-episode <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/anime/42203/\" rel=\"nofollow\">second cour</a> in Winter 2021. Cunchyroll simulcast the season as they aired in Japan.<br>\n<br>\nPV 1<br>\n<iframe class=\"movie youtube\" width=\"425\" height=\"355\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/HS1zsxreqvw?rel=1\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><br>\n<br>\nSource: Press Release",
